The city council may suspend the manager from office for a period not to exceed 45 days, or remove from office the manager, at any time and for any reason which the city council by affirmative vote of the majority may determine, upon such terms and conditions as the city council may determine;
Or, if the manager has a contract in place, the Council may refer to the terms of the contract.
(Ord. No. 2025-03, 6-9-2025)

